{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方金色大字“憋着一股气”，随后被下方同样醒目的灰色大字“那点高兴还没退”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能感受到某种情绪状态，看不出人物此刻具体经历了什么。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、压着一股气，同时还残留一点高兴，有情绪拉扯感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"正文里脚步凌乱、和弦重击、节奏忽强忽弱、旋律彼此缠绕等具体描述，以及这些表现与人物处境之间的关系。右上角阶段目录也基本不会被第一眼注意到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"放大的词本身说不出处境，主要传达的是情绪状态。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里，要结合下方正文才能理解情绪与处境的关系。\",\n    \"正文单块较长，包含多个不同的音乐表现和情绪描述，需要进一步阅读才能获得具体信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "04d0b97a-035a-42d6-a2fc-35fcc570a617", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022003153986Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.328, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:20:19.485132+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d1f1c5c4d7940c2196dd7c4b572bc120fb30d391fbd0c358237338634fee89bc", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68